[00:09.72]Life everlasting is promised.
[00:14.12]Our earthly home will endure.
[00:18.60]‘Meek ones will thrive,’ said the psalmist.
[00:23.16]This grand future is sure.
[00:27.45](Chorus)
[00:27.60]We can live forever.
[00:32.26]It’s worth all endeavor.
[00:36.36]God’s promise is faithful.
[00:41.10]His Word will come true.
[00:52.43]Paradise brought to perfection;
[00:56.88]All of God’s children set free.
[01:01.46]Under Jehovah’s direction,
[01:05.98]Peace on earth we will see.
[01:10.21](Chorus)
[01:10.36]We can live forever.
[01:15.07]It’s worth all endeavor.
[01:19.47]God’s promise is faithful.
[01:23.90]His Word will come true.
[01:35.06]Soon in the grand resurrection,
[01:38.96]Sorrow will all disappear.
[01:44.14]Showering tender affection,
[01:48.66]God will dry ev’ry tear.
[01:53.01](Chorus)
[01:53.16]We can live forever.
[01:57.81]It’s worth all endeavor.
[02:01.91]God’s promise is faithful.
[02:06.64]His Word will come true.
